{
  "name": "Shell",
  "group": "layout",
  "description": "Estructura general de una aplicación. Los paneles laterales se acoplan si caben y pasan a cajón con velo si no.",
  "import": "import { Shell } from \"@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zout\"",
  "exports": ["Shell"],
  "zones": [
    {
      "name": "titlebar",
      "accepts": "TitleBar",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "name": "rail",
      "accepts": "Rail",
      "optional": true,
      "token": "rail-width"
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar",
      "accepts": "ShellPanel con Sidebar o SidePanel",
      "optional": true,
      "token": "sidebar-width"
    },
    {
      "name": "header",
      "accepts": "título, pestañas, acciones",
      "optional": true,
      "token": "header-height"
    },
    {
      "name": "children",
      "accepts": "Page, SplitPane o contenido propio"
    },
    {
      "name": "inspector",
      "accepts": "ShellPanel con SidePanel",
      "optional": true,
      "token": "inspector-width"
    },
    {
      "name": "overlays",
      "accepts": "capas flotantes propias",
      "optional": true
    }
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "sidebar",
      "type": "ShellPanel",
      "description": "{ content, label, open?, mode?: 'auto'|'docked'|'overlay', width?, minWidth?, maxWidth?, defaultWidth?, onResize?, resizeLabel? }"
    },
    {
      "name": "inspector",
      "type": "ShellPanel"
    },
    {
      "name": "surface",
      "type": "enum",
      "values": ["glass", "solid", "none"],
      "default": "glass",
      "description": "`solid` para lectura o edición de texto denso."
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebarBreakpoint",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 880,
      "description": "Ancho del shell bajo el cual la sidebar `auto` pasa a cajón."
    },
    {
      "name": "inspectorBreakpoint",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 1180
    },
    {
      "name": "railBreakpoint",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 600,
      "description": "Ancho del shell (px) bajo el cual el rail deja su columna y se muestra dentro del cajón de la sidebar, si la sidebar es un cajón. En el modo DOM, `data-rail-breakpoint` en `.z-shell`."
    },
    {
      "name": "onCloseOverlay",
      "type": "() => void",
      "description": "Cierra el cajón abierto (velo o Escape)."
    },
    {
      "name": "onModeChange",
      "type": "(modes: { sidebar: \"docked\" | \"overlay\"; inspector: \"docked\" | \"overlay\" }) => void",
      "description": "Avisa del modo que corresponde a cada panel según el ancho medido, esté abierto o no. Sirve para cerrar los paneles cuando pasan a cajón."
    },
    {
      "name": "closeOverlayLabel",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "Close panel"
    },
    {
      "name": "skipLinkLabel",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Texto del enlace «saltar al contenido»: primer elemento enfocable del shell, visible solo con el foco, que lleva al área principal (WCAG 2.4.1). Sin valor no se dibuja."
    },
    {
      "name": "mainAs",
      "type": "enum",
      "values": ["main", "div", "section"],
      "default": "main",
      "description": "Elemento del área principal. Solo puede haber un <main> visible por documento: un Shell anidado o un segundo Shell en la misma página usa `div` o `section`."
    }
  ],
  "tokens": [
    "shell-gap",
    "sidebar-width",
    "inspector-width",
    "header-height",
    "stage-pad-x",
    "panel-radius",
    "scrim",
    "layer-overlay",
    "line",
    "accent-ring",
    "control-radius",
    "duration-normal",
    "duration-slow",
    "ease-emphasized",
    "ease-out",
    "fg",
    "focus-offset",
    "focus-width",
    "glass-border",
    "layer-top",
    "popup-bg",
    "popup-blur",
    "popup-shadow",
    "shadow-md",
    "space-2",
    "space-3",
    "space-4",
    "surface-solid",
    "text-small",
    "weight-medium"
  ],
  "classes": ["z-shell"],
  "a11y": "Regiones: la TitleBar es <header> (banner), el Rail es <nav> (navigation), el área principal es <main> (o lo que diga `mainAs`) y los paneles son <aside> con nombre (complementary). `skipLinkLabel` añade un enlace para saltar al contenido. En estrecho (`railBreakpoint`) el rail entra en el cajón de la sidebar, dentro del diálogo, y sale del orden de tabulación mientras está cerrado. En modo cajón el panel es role=dialog con aria-modal, recibe el foco al abrirse y lo devuelve al cerrarse; el rail, el área principal y el otro panel quedan inertes, y Escape o el velo lo cierran. La barra de título sigue operable para poder alternar los paneles. Escape no cierra el cajón si lo gestiona una capa por encima (un <dialog> o un popover abiertos). Sigue la dirección de escritura: en RTL la sidebar y su cajón quedan a la derecha. Antes de medirse (HTML de servidor, o antes de init()), un panel `auto` que no cabe no se muestra.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Aplicación con rail, sidebar e inspector",
      "code": "<Shell\n  rail={<Rail><RailItem icon=\"home\" label=\"Home\" active /><RailItem icon=\"gear\" label=\"Settings\" /></Rail>}\n  sidebar={{ label: \"Navigation\", open: sidebarOpen, content: <Sidebar><SidebarSection title=\"Projects\" count={3}>…</SidebarSection></Sidebar> }}\n  inspector={{ label: \"Details\", open: detailsOpen, content: <SidePanel title=\"Details\">…</SidePanel> }}\n  onCloseOverlay={closePanels}\n>\n  <Page header={<PageHeader title=\"Overview\" />}>…</Page>\n</Shell>"
    }
  ],
  "behavior": "dom",
  "html": [
    {
      "title": "Shell con barra de título, rail, sidebar redimensionable e inspector",
      "code": "<div style=\"width:100%;height:360px\">\n  <div class=\"z-shell z-canvas z-root\" id=\"shell-demo\">\n    <a class=\"z-shell__skip\" href=\"#shell-demo-main\">Skip to content</a>\n    <header class=\"z-titlebar\">\n      <div class=\"z-titlebar__brand\">\n        <button type=\"button\" title=\"Toggle navigation\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-z-shell-toggle=\"sidebar\">\n          <z-icon name=\"bars-3\" size=\"16\"></z-icon>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"z-titlebar__center\"></div>\n      <div class=\"z-titlebar__actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" title=\"Toggle details panel\" aria-label=\"Toggle details panel\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-z-shell-toggle=\"inspector\">\n          <z-icon name=\"adjustments-horizontal\" size=\"16\"></z-icon>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"z-shell__body\">\n      <div class=\"z-shell__rail\">\n        <nav class=\"z-rail z-liquid\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n          <div class=\"z-rail__items\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-rail__item\" aria-label=\"Home\" title=\"Home\" aria-current=\"page\">\n              <z-icon name=\"home\" variant=\"solid\" size=\"20\"></z-icon>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-rail__item\" aria-label=\"Settings\" title=\"Settings\">\n              <z-icon name=\"gear\" size=\"20\"></z-icon>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"z-liquid z-shell__side\" aria-label=\"Navigation\" data-side=\"left\">\n        <div class=\"z-shell__panel-body\">\n          <div class=\"z-sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"z-sidebar__sections\">\n              <section class=\"z-sidebar__section\" data-open=\"true\">\n                <div class=\"z-sidebar__head\">\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-sidebar__fold\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"shell-demo-projects\">\n                    <z-icon name=\"chevron-down-small\" size=\"12\"></z-icon>\n                    <span class=\"z-sidebar__title\">Projects</span>\n                    <span class=\"z-sidebar__count\">2</span>\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"z-sidebar__body\" id=\"shell-demo-projects\">\n                  <nav aria-label=\"Projects\" class=\"z-navlist\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-navlink\" aria-current=\"page\" data-active=\"true\" data-z-close>\n                      <span class=\"z-navlink__icon\">\n                        <z-icon name=\"folder\" variant=\"solid\" size=\"16\"></z-icon>\n                      </span>\n                      <span class=\"z-navlink__label\">Atlas</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-navlink\" data-z-close>\n                      <span class=\"z-navlink__icon\">\n                        <z-icon name=\"folder\" size=\"16\"></z-icon>\n                      </span>\n                      <span class=\"z-navlink__label\">Borealis</span>\n                    </button>\n                  </nav>\n                </div>\n              </section>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" aria-label=\"Resize Navigation\" aria-valuenow=\"224\" aria-valuemin=\"180\" aria-valuemax=\"360\" class=\"z-resize\" data-side=\"end\" data-default-size=\"224\"></div>\n      </aside>\n      <main class=\"z-shell__main z-liquid\" id=\"shell-demo-main\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n        <div class=\"z-shell__content\">\n          <div class=\"z-page\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Page content\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <div class=\"z-container\" data-width=\"content\">\n              <header class=\"z-pagehead\">\n                <div class=\"z-pagehead__row\">\n                  <div class=\"z-pagehead__text\">\n                    <h1 class=\"z-pagehead__title\">Overview</h1>\n                    <p class=\"z-pagehead__description\">Panels dock when the shell is wide enough and become drawers when it is not.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </header>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </main>\n      <aside class=\"z-liquid z-shell__inspector\" aria-label=\"Details\" data-side=\"right\">\n        <div class=\"z-shell__panel-body\">\n          <section class=\"z-sidepanel\">\n            <div class=\"z-sidepanel__head\">\n              <div class=\"z-sidepanel__titles\">\n                <div class=\"z-sidepanel__title\">Details</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"z-sidepanel__actions\">\n                <button type=\"button\" title=\"Close details\" aria-label=\"Close details\" class=\"z-btn z-btn--icon z-btn--ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-z-close>\n                  <z-icon name=\"x-mark\" size=\"16\"></z-icon>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"z-sidepanel__body\" data-padded=\"true\">Atlas, updated two hours ago.</div>\n          </section>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "origin": "AppShell de zutool."
}
